# CMDEDIT-SEL-03: metal1-m2c-metal2 net; select at 5 5 repeated (cycling).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
box 4 4 6 6
paint m2c
box 0 0 20 6
paint metal2
select at 5 5
select bbox
what -list
select at 5 5
select at 5 5
select bbox
what -list
select at 5 5
select bbox
